<meta type=book title="Section numbering off (the default)">
</meta>

<chapter #ch:methods | Methods>

A book with no `<config number-sections>` — the default since #246/core. Headings carry no number, and a
cross-reference to a heading shows its TITLE: see <ref @sec:setup> and <ref @ch:results>. Float numbering is
independent and stays on, so a reference to a figure still resolves: <ref @fig:plot>.

<section #sec:setup | Setup>

Setup details, used throughout.

<figure #fig:plot | A diagnostic plot.>

<chapter #ch:results | Results>

The results build on the approach in <ref @ch:methods>.
